    "chunk_text": "ine, se w\u00e6s of Su\u00f0seaxna cynne \u00deissum tidum Middelengle mid Peadan Pendan sunu \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges Cristes geleafan & W\u00e6s he Peada ging \u00e6\u00f0eling good & cyninges noman & hada wel wyr\u00f0e; & se f\u00e6der him for\u00f0on \u00dea com he to Oswi\u00e6 Nor\u00f0anhymbra cyninge, & b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t he him Ealhfl\u00e6de his dohtor to wife Ne hine mon on o\u00f0re wisan his bene tyg\u00feian wolde, nemne he Cristes geleafan onfenge mid \u00fea \u00dea he \u00f0a gehyrde so\u00f0f\u00e6stnesse bodunge & lare & \u00fe\u00e6t gehat \u00fe\u00e6s heofonlican rices & \u00e6rest hyht Ond he w\u00e6s swi\u00f0ust gesponen to onfonne Cristes geleafan from Oswies suna \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges, \u00fe\u00e6s Se w\u00e6s his m\u00e6g & his freond; h\u00e6fde his sweostor to wife, seo w\u00e6s haten Cyneburg Pendan \u00dea w\u00e6s he gefulwad from Finano \u00fe\u00e6m biscope mid eallum his geferum, \u00fee mid him cwomon, & & he onfeng, & se cyning him sealde feower m\u00e6ssepreostas, \u00fea sceoldon his \u00feeode fulwian & W\u00e6ron \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas \u00feus hatne, Cedd & Adda & Bete & Deoma. Se nyhsta w\u00e6s Scyttisces cynnes; \u00fea o\u00f0re w\u00e6ron Englisce. W\u00e6s se Adda Uttan bro\u00f0or \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ran m\u00e6ssepreostes & abbudes \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres, \u00fee nemned is \u00dea heo \u00fea \u00fea gemyndgedan sacerdas in \u00fea m\u00e6g\u00f0e cwomon mid Peadan \u00feone cyning, & \u00fe\u00e6r Ne bewerede Penda se cyning \u00feon ma, gif hwelce men wolde in",
